From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tor-socks5 maintainers <noreply@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] tor-dirclient: bound response bodies by Content-Length

Limit the on-wire response body to its declared Content-Length and report
EOF before that length as a protocol error. Preserve absent-length behavior
and validate malformed or conflicting length headers.

Apply after 01-idle-body.patch: the regression tests share the added
src/local_test.rs module.

